  "description": "C# client SDK for RecallDB, a multi-tenant RESTful vector database service built on PostgreSQL with pgvector. Provides typed access to tenants, users, credentials, collections, documents, labels, tags, and vector, full-text, and hybrid search.",
  "id": "RecallDb.Sdk",
