  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "SDK 0.2.2: single-call hybrid search options (Hybrid Strategy, RrfK, CandidatePool, RecencyWeight), result collapse (Collapse), FullText MatchMode and MinimumShouldMatch, stored vectors on request (IncludeEmbeddings), per-hit VectorScore, VectorRank, TextRank, RecencyRank, GroupKey, and GroupHits, search Notices, typed server info with capabilities (GetServerInfoAsync, SupportsAsync), constructors that accept an HttpClient or HttpMessageHandler, a per-request Timeout, cancellation of response reads, compact request JSON, URL-encoding of every path segment, structured errors (ErrorCode, ErrorMessage), string constants, and nullable annotations. Behavior change: Exists methods now throw on any status other than 200 or 404. See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
